{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomcraft is an endless garden survival sim where beauty is fragile.</strong><br>Every flower you plant brings coins and color to your garden\u2014but also raises upkeep and risk. Weeds spread, blight creeps in, and chaotic mutations threaten to overwhelm your designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prune weak flowers, refine new hybrids in the Lab, and arrange your garden for harmony and variety to win the Flower Queen\u2019s favor. Balance survival with creativity, or watch your masterpiece wither away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong><br>\ud83c\udf31 Endless survival \u2014 balance growth against upkeep<br>\ud83c\udf38 Harmony and beauty \u2014 symmetry and variety matter<br>\ud83c\udf3f Weeds, blight, and chaotic mutations to overcome<br>\ud83d\udd2c Mutation Lab \u2014 refine, evolve, and discover new flowers</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625230?t=1774264033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625230?t=1774264033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625230/60b0b79b2ec0abdd107da90e80fc495ace53f1a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774264033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625230/60b0b79b2ec0abdd107da90e80fc495ace53f1a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774264033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomcraft is an endless garden survival sim where beauty is fragile.</strong><br>Every flower you plant brings coins and color to your garden\u2014but also raises upkeep and risk. Weeds spread, blight creeps in, and chaotic mutations threaten to overwhelm your designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prune weak flowers, refine new hybrids in